    <string name="toc_note">
        Note: The gPlayer app does not facilitate downloading, converting, or streaming content from unauthorised third-party sources such as YouTube, Instagram, or similar services. Instead, it is designed to work exclusively with the user’s personal TG account using the official TDLib API.
        The app allows only the authenticated TG user to log in with their own account.
        No external or unauthorised third-party content sources are used. The app follows official TDLib API usage guidelines.
        This app functions as a personal TG media manager for the signed-in user and does not provide or promote unauthorised downloads from any third-party platforms.
        Reference : official TDLib API documentation</string>
